// IBM 360 Assembly - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

        * IBM System/360 assembler
* WTO writes a line to the operator console, which is what this machine had
        HELLO   START
        WTO    'HELLO WORLD'
        BRANCH  HELLO
        END     HELLO
